menu "CNC diagnostic service"
config CNC_SERVICE_HOST_RX_GPIO
    int "Read-only host UART RX GPIO (-1 disables hardware link)"
    range -1 48
    default -1
    help
        Assign only after the ESP32-S3 module pin map is reviewed. No UART TX
        or machine-control GPIO is configured by this firmware. Kconfig cannot
        express holes in the range, so service_main.c rejects at compile time:
        19 and 20 (USB Serial/JTAG console), 22-25 (do not exist on ESP32-S3)
        and 26-32 (module SPI flash bus). Modules with octal PSRAM also use
        33-37; check the module datasheet before choosing those.
endmenu
